mposter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by <span style=\"color: yellow;\">4%</span> per flower. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903150200\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 116/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 102/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 56/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1240184/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.301      1 -total\n 99.75%   52.170      2 Template:Objects\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1117-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903150200 and revision id 18743. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Limited","Items","Event_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Flora Laura","exists":true},{"title":"Flowering Meadows","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true},{"title":"Press Machine","exists":true}],"images":["Rose_box.png","Rose_Unboxed.png"]}
